Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.98,0:00:06.69,Default,I,0,0,0,,The Imagawa army's vanguard,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.69,0:00:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,lead by Matsudaira Motoyasu, has surrounded Marune Fortress with a force of 3,000 men.{I'm assuming this should be Motoyasu, not Moteyasu}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.69,0:00:13.06,Default,I,0,0,0,,The other fortresses are \Nunder attack as well,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.06,0:00:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and the total enemy force is \Nbelieved to exceed 25,000 men.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.97,0:00:19.87,Default,N,0,0,0,,So, they did come while we were gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.23,0:00:22.06,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's finally started.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.06,0:00:25.12,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}The biggest event of Lord \NNobunaga's Ambition...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.45,0:00:27.20,Default,N,0,0,0,,Oda's finished.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.20,0:00:30.14,Default,N,0,0,0,,"Owari" means "finished" in Japanese anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.14,0:00:32.76,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,That joke only gets five points, Princess.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.13,0:00:34.82,Default,I,0,0,0,,We need to counterattack.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.82,0:00:35.96,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.96,0:00:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our force only numbers 3,000—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.12,0:00:40.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,Give up and it's game over.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.87,0:00:43.61,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna, you can win.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.61,0:00:46.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,No. Against Imagawa Yoshimoto,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,only {\i1}you{\i0} could.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.60,0:00:48.40,Default,I,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.81,0:00:50.86,Default,I,0,0,0,,Is the Oda clan going to survive?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.86,0:00:51.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.40,0:00:53.00,Default,S,0,0,0,,The plan is...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.00,0:00:54.62,Default,N,0,0,0,,No need to say it.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.69,0:00:56.64,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.28,0:00:58.96,Default,N,0,0,0,,You're fired.
