Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.27,0:02:32.38,Default,S,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.73,0:02:34.90,Default,N,0,0,0,,Because you acted without my permission.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.90,0:02:37.18,Default,N,0,0,0,,You ignored my orders and \Nwent ahead on your own.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.18,0:02:38.64,Default,N,0,0,0,,Of course you're fired.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.64,0:02:40.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.02,0:02:42.30,Default,N,0,0,0,,You left without a word to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.41,0:02:45.29,Default,N,0,0,0,,That's too selfish.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.29,0:02:48.01,Default,N,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear \Nanother word from you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.01,0:02:48.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.73,0:02:51.94,Default,N,0,0,0,,Don't do any other unnecessary things.{Don't do anything else \Nthat you don't need to.}{meh. Can't think how to rephrase this}{How's dat?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.45,0:02:55.86,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Yoshiharu was \Nconcerned about you.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.86,0:02:57.80,Default,N,0,0,0,,And he didn't need to be!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.80,0:03:01.30,Default,I,0,0,0,,But Monkey has the \Npower to see the future!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.30,0:03:02.32,Default,I,0,0,0,,He may know how to win...{Not sure this can be shortened, but it feels too long. Maybe adjust the timing?}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.32,0:03:05.83,Default,N,0,0,0,,If we hadn't rushed here, \Neveryone would've died.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.83,0:03:08.58,Default,N,0,0,0,,Or did you go with full knowledge that you would die?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.58,0:03:10.42,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.42,0:03:14.38,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sure, this wasn't in the game, \Nso I was in trouble, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.69,0:03:20.26,Default,N,0,0,0,,You said that you'd make \Nmy dream come true,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but those were just words!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.87,0:03:25.81,Default,N,0,0,0,,I hate liars like you!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.01,0:03:31.12,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Marune and Washidzu are under \Nattack by Matsudaira Motoyasu,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.12,0:03:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Asahina Yasutomo, and their 3,000.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.36,0:03:35.72,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Oodaka Castle is under \Nattack by Udono Nagateru.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.72,0:03:38.35,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Narumi Castle by Okabe Motonobu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.35,0:03:40.45,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,They're attacking on all fronts.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.45,0:03:43.72,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,It won't be long before they attack Kiyosu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.33,0:03:46.45,Default,I,0,0,0,,Where's Lord Nobuna?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.93,0:03:49.04,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,After returning from Nagara River,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.04,0:03:51.62,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,she went into her room and won't come out.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.50,0:03:54.75,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,While Owari's in grave danger!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.32,0:03:57.94,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,If only Lord Nobuhide were still alive...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.42,0:04:03.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's just like Nobuna said.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.26,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm all talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything by myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.63,0:04:11.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,And because of that, I got \Nthe Kawanamishuu killed.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.59,0:04:14.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm scum.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.05,0:04:16.06,Default,D,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.15,0:04:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you also saved others.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.87,0:04:22.98,Default,S,0,0,0,,Old man...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.75,0:04:26.91,Default,D,0,0,0,,A splendid city.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.27,0:04:32.91,Default,D,0,0,0,,Only Oda Nobuna could create \Nand defend such a place.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.61,0:04:36.52,Default,D,0,0,0,,Can we really defeat the Imagawa?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.29,0:04:39.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's a super famous event in history.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.79,0:04:45.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's only after winning this battle \Nthat Oda truly becomes a conquerer.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.93,0:04:48.82,Default,D,0,0,0,,Is that the future you know?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.82,0:04:49.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.60,0:04:52.18,Default,D,0,0,0,,But in that future,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.18,0:04:54.69,Default,D,0,0,0,,I'm dead, am I not?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.55,0:04:57.20,Default,S,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.20,0:05:01.82,Default,D,0,0,0,,You changed the future to \Nsave Nobuna from suffering.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.82,0:05:06.70,Default,D,0,0,0,,How can you be certain that the future\Nwhere she wins is still possible?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.15,0:05:09.28,Default,D,0,0,0,,Nobuna is a genius.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.28,0:05:11.40,Default,D,0,0,0,,She's likely realized this
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.40,0:05:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and decided not to take you to a\N battle she has no hope of winning.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.90,0:05:17.62,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.62,0:05:19.71,Default,D,0,0,0,,You said it yourself:
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.03,0:05:23.59,Default,D,0,0,0,,the people whom she loves die.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.93,0:05:25.82,Default,D,0,0,0,,You know what she's like.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.82,0:05:30.06,Default,D,0,0,0,,The only way she could show \Nhow she felt was by firing you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.06,0:05:31.62,Default,D,0,0,0,,Forgive her.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.81,0:05:36.23,Default,S,0,0,0,,That fool...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.09,0:05:46.78,Default,S,0,0,0,,I loved historical simulation games of this period.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.73,0:05:49.78,Default,S,0,0,0,,I've always loved this era.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.11,0:05:55.29,Default,S,0,0,0,,I was so happy that the history I learned\Nin the games could help everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.75,0:05:59.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,And maybe that made \Nme change the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.79,0:06:01.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.37,0:06:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,because I knew that history,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to save you, Saitou Dousan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.33,0:06:11.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,I can save Nobuna, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.93,0:06:23.42,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}Child, go do the job that only you can do.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.19,0:06:27.20,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}History is on my side.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.36,0:06:29.94,Default,I,0,0,0,,I will go as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.29,0:06:33.74,Default,G,0,0,0,,We stand with Sagara.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.85,0:06:38.83,Default,G,0,0,0,,We will follow you into hell itself.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.21,0:06:42.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,Thanks, everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.57,0:06:45.46,Default,S,0,0,0,,We've got another tough mission.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.73,0:06:51.80,Default,G,0,0,0,,So, where do we go?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.80,0:06:53.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,Okehazama.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.93,0:06:55.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,According to what I learned from my game,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.92,0:06:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagawa Yoshimoto should be resting there.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.01,0:07:03.06,Default,G,0,0,0,,We can't launch an attack on our own.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.21,0:07:06.77,Default,S,0,0,0,,Just locating her camp will be enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.77,0:07:08.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna will do the rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.55,0:07:12.95,Default,G,0,0,0,,What if she doesn't believe your report?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.57,0:07:15.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,She'll believe it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.49,0:07:18.37,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,You'll owe the boss big if we win.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.37,0:07:19.25,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.25,0:07:25.25,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,But kid, if you touch our eternal idol, Boss Goemon... we'll kill you.{Man, does this line sound like shit, but hell if I know what to do with it.}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.73,0:07:27.76,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,The boss will never...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.29,0:07:29.92,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,be tainted!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.85,0:07:32.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,Guys...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.37,0:07:43.30,Default,Hattori,0,0,0,,I've burned all their \Nprovisions and gunpowder.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.30,0:07:44.36,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.87,0:07:48.23,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Let's all go kick 'em around, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.41,0:07:52.25,Default,G,0,0,0,,That is Okehazama Mountain!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.25,0:07:53.28,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mountain?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.73,0:07:56.10,Default,G,0,0,0,,Okehazama is a mountain.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.12,0:08:00.52,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, the game and reality are different?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.52,0:08:04.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oda never attacked a mountain \Nin the TV shows, either!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.92,0:08:08.84,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did changing the future turn \NOkehazama into a mountain?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.84,0:08:11.32,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did I take the wrong \Nchoice at the route split,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.32,0:08:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and now I'm heading for a bad end?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.14,0:08:16.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,Save me, Goemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.39,0:08:19.44,Default,G,0,0,0,,S-Stay calm!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.44,0:08:20.64,Default,G,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.64,0:08:22.64,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Kill!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.41,0:08:28.70,Default,Nk,0,0,0,,There's never a dull \Nmoment with you, Monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.70,0:08:30.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobukatsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.35,0:08:32.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,No... Nobusumi?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.26,0:08:36.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,I lose.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.54,0:08:38.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,I have completely lost this one.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.53,0:08:40.64,Default,Nk,0,0,0,,What's got you down?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.64,0:08:41.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.82,0:08:44.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,And what are you doing here, anyway?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.19,0:08:47.34,Default,Nk,0,0,0,,Let me help, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.34,0:08:49.36,Default,Nk,0,0,0,,I want to help my sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.95,0:08:51.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.23,0:08:54.66,Default,S,0,0,0,,My plan's through.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.66,0:08:56.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,If Okehazama's a mountain,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.21,0:08:59.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,we can't launch a sneak attack on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.73,0:09:04.64,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Um, there's a flat part of \NOkehazama, not just the mountain.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.31,0:09:11.10,Default,I,0,0,0,,Once Matsudaira's taken Marune,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.10,0:09:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,they can take the lead to Kiyosu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.18,0:09:17.08,Default,H,0,0,0,,But our force has suffered \Nheavy casualties.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.87,0:09:20.22,Default,I,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.22,0:09:23.91,Default,I,0,0,0,,Motoyasu's a crafty one. \NShe'd never fight like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.29,0:09:26.62,Default,I,0,0,0,,Matsudaira's force is \Nto proceed onwards.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.62,0:09:27.74,Default,I,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.71,0:09:29.36,Default,H,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.49,0:09:36.54,Default,H,0,0,0,,The Mikawa country samurai can be \Nthe ones to take all the damage.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.75,0:09:41.14,Default,H,0,0,0,,We will enter the capital \Nelegantly and unscathed.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.49,0:09:45.80,Default,H,0,0,0,,That is how a noble fights.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.31,0:09:52.28,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's definitely it. It's Yoshimoto's camp.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.81,0:09:54.32,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,This place doesn't have a name,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.32,0:09:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but we locals call it Okehazama.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.32,0:09:59.84,Default,S,0,0,0,,Then it's decided.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.84,0:10:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A sneak attack here and, \Njust like the game, Oda wins.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.67,0:10:06.20,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobusumi, you stall them.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.20,0:10:07.21,Default,Nk,0,0,0,,Stall them?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.57,0:10:10.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,This is the only place a \Nsneak attack will work.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.05,0:10:16.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,Use the girls to serve sake \Nto their army and buy time.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.02,0:10:17.97,Default,Nk,0,0,0,,Leave that to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.29,0:10:21.34,Default,Nk,0,0,0,,I'll seduce Yoshimoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.25,0:10:24.47,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Master Nobusumi, you cheater!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.47,0:10:29.12,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Take care of us after the \Njob's done, too. Okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.47,0:10:31.80,Default,Nk,0,0,0,,Of course I will!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.80,0:10:35.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,As much as it pisses me off,\NI'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.51,0:10:37.40,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,We can't stay holed up in our castle!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.87,0:10:41.00,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto's first priority \Nis to make it to Kyoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.00,0:10:44.66,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,If we don't attack her, she \Nmay very well ignore Kiyosu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.81,0:10:47.90,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,If we don't fight, we'll be destroyed.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.90,0:10:49.10,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Two points.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.17,0:10:53.52,Default,I,0,0,0,,Your retainers are divided \Nin their opinions.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.52,0:10:56.17,Default,I,0,0,0,,Without you, no decision will be reached.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.17,0:10:57.28,Default,I,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.89,0:11:00.48,Default,N,0,0,0,,Where's Monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.25,0:11:03.43,Default,I,0,0,0,,Nowhere to be found in the castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.43,0:11:04.30,Default,N,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.41,0:11:09.32,Default,N,0,0,0,,Even a dog doesn't forget \Na favor it's received,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.32,0:11:11.44,Default,N,0,0,0,,but I guess a monkey does.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.47,0:11:15.22,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is for the best.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.13,0:11:21.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.10,0:11:22.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,We need to hurry and tell Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.95,0:11:27.58,Default,G,0,0,0,,Imagawa ninjas?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.93,0:11:33.72,Default,H,0,0,0,,So, you found Yoshimoto's camp.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.72,0:11:35.24,Default,H,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.24,0:11:37.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,A ninja! A real ninja!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.60,0:11:39.34,Default,G,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm a real ninja, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.98,0:11:53.98,Default,G,0,0,0,,Sagara, I'll hold them off.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.00,0:11:56.65,Default,G,0,0,0,,Hurry and get to the princess!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.97,0:11:57.74,Default,S,0,0,0,,You dummy!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.74,0:12:00.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,I can't leave you here and run!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.54,0:12:01.74,Default,Inuchiyo,0,0,0,,You're the dummy.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.29,0:12:05.78,Default,G,0,0,0,,Somebody must tell Nobuna \Nthe location of their camp.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.78,0:12:07.45,Default,S,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.33,0:12:12.96,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,647)}Go do the job that only you can do.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.21,0:12:17.00,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Don't worry, kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.32,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Leave those two to us.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.61,0:12:22.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,Guys...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.97,0:12:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay alive!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.19,0:12:38.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.08,0:12:39.64,Default,H,0,0,0,,Excellent dodge.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.85,0:12:44.98,Default,H,0,0,0,,I, Hattori Hanzou,\Nnever let my prey escape.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.98,0:12:47.32,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hattori Hanzou... Motoyasu's ninja?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.73,0:12:52.95,Default,H,0,0,0,,Nobody has ever seen me and lived.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.95,0:12:55.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,Then I'll pretend I didn't see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.69,0:13:11.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.57,0:13:16.85,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,499)}I'm sorry, Nobuna.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.85,0:13:20.33,Default,N,0,0,0,,You really are nothing but talk.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.33,0:13:22.60,Default,N,0,0,0,,Did you forget your promise with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.49,0:13:26.66,Default,S,0,0,0,,I can't make everyone else fight
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.03,0:13:31.42,Default,S,0,0,0,,and then give up myself!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.41,0:13:35.79,Default,H,0,0,0,,I commend your fighting spirit.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.61,0:13:38.24,Default,H,0,0,0,,But it's useless.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.24,0:13:39.67,Default,H,0,0,0,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.09,0:13:43.66,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't beat him in a straight fight.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.66,0:13:44.80,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I can...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.47,0:13:50.75,Default,S,0,0,0,,Imagawa Yoshimoto is never going \Nto let Motoyasu have Mikawa.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.75,0:13:53.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,One of these days, she'll sacrifice \NMotoyasu for her own ambitions.{Probably too long, but I can't think of an alternate phrasing that's suitable.}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.43,0:13:57.30,Default,S,0,0,0,,If Motoyasu wants independence, now's the time!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.93,0:14:00.48,Default,H,0,0,0,,So, you would have my lord rebel?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.48,0:14:02.24,Default,S,0,0,0,,She doesn't need to.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.24,0:14:04.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobuna{\i0} will defeat Imagawa.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.96,0:14:07.90,Default,H,0,0,0,,That fool Oda could \Nnever defeat Imagawa.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.45,0:14:09.07,Default,S,0,0,0,,She can!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.57,0:14:12.95,Default,S,0,0,0,,The battle of Okehazama will \Nend with Oda's victory.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.05,0:14:16.03,Default,H,0,0,0,,So {\i1}you're{\i0} Monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.03,0:14:16.83,Default,S,0,0,0,,You know m—
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.97,0:14:22.48,Default,H,0,0,0,,If Oda attacks Mikawa after her \Nvictory, then we gain nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.48,0:14:25.59,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna will form an \Nalliance with Motoyasu.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.25,0:14:28.20,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll make her.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.67,0:14:34.68,Default,H,0,0,0,,Then you're free to try.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.95,0:14:39.19,Default,H,0,0,0,,But if you don't keep your promise,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.19,0:14:43.19,Default,H,0,0,0,,someday I will come to kill you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.63,0:14:48.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll make it back to Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.60,0:14:50.20,Default,S,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.21,0:14:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}my{\i0} Okehazama.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.45,0:15:00.04,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Washidzu and Marune have both fallen.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.47,0:15:02.02,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Our forces have been wiped out.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.51,0:15:04.32,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Both have fallen?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.32,0:15:05.44,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Surrender!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.44,0:15:06.86,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We must surrender!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.43,0:15:09.68,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,And hand the princess over to the enemy?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.68,0:15:11.58,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,No retainer should ever speak those words.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.58,0:15:12.76,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Zero points.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.09,0:15:15.56,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Stupid girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.51,0:15:19.23,Default,I,0,0,0,,And you're a man who's whining like a girl!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.63,0:15:29.70,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.05,0:15:35.78,Default,N,0,0,0,,Why are you...?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.69,0:15:40.37,Default,N,0,0,0,,Blood?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.99,0:15:42.84,Default,N,0,0,0,,How did you get that wound?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.84,0:15:44.13,Default,S,0,0,0,,Forget that.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.67,0:15:47.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,I've found Imagawa Yoshimoto's camp.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.49,0:15:52.01,Default,S,0,0,0,,At the base of Okehazama Mountain on the east side.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.00,0:15:55.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,There's a force of approximately 5,000.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.08,0:15:58.88,Default,S,0,0,0,,They're resting and completely cut \Noff from the rest of their forces.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.88,0:16:01.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobusumi's group is stalling them.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.92,0:16:05.44,Default,S,0,0,0,,This is all I can do.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.47,0:16:10.76,Default,N,0,0,0,,What kind of future do you see?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.95,0:16:16.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's your path to follow, Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.05,0:16:19.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,You choose what to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.69,0:16:22.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll shut up and follow you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.01,0:16:26.12,Default,N,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.05,0:16:38.14,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8}Twenty years to a man...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.14,0:16:42.85,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8}are but a single day \Nas seen from heaven.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.85,0:17:12.26,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8}Is there anyone born who \Ndoes not someday die?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.15,0:17:14.34,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Atsumori dance.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.34,0:17:16.20,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're ready, Nobuna.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.57,0:17:33.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,We will attack the Imagawa \Ncamp with all our forces!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.49,0:17:43.84,Default,Nk,0,0,0,,Since we're here at Atsuta Shrine,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.84,0:17:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,why not offer a prayer \Nto the gods for victory?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.26,0:17:47.17,Default,N,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.73,0:17:52.20,Default,N,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna \Nleave this country a mess?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.20,0:17:56.38,Default,N,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll take over for \Nyou and protect the people.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.38,0:17:57.82,Default,N,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.82,0:18:00.39,Default,N,0,0,0,,If you've got that, then make sure I win.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.91,0:18:01.89,Default,N,0,0,0,,We clear?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.85,0:18:09.90,Default,N,0,0,0,,The god sitting in the back of the shrine tells me we're gonna win for sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.01,0:18:17.45,Default,S,0,0,0,,Looks like the gods are pissed.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.79,0:18:19.42,Default,N,0,0,0,,This is divine providence.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.42,0:18:22.86,Default,N,0,0,0,,The rain will provide cover as we attack!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.97,0:18:27.94,Default,N,0,0,0,,The enemy's at Okehazama!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.50,0:18:33.34,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,Look at this rain.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.34,0:18:35.84,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,I can't even play with my ball.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.41,0:18:41.68,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,Huh? Where did young \NNobusumi and his friends go?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.68,0:18:44.38,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We haven't seen them for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.27,0:18:53.82,Default,N,0,0,0,,Our target is Imagawa Yoshimoto, and her alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.17,0:18:56.90,Default,N,0,0,0,,All forces, advance!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.03,0:19:07.17,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.17,0:19:08.38,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,An enemy attack!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.38,0:19:10.00,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,All forces intercept!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.03,0:19:11.92,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.92,0:19:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all drunk, and we \Ncan't fight in this rain!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.63,0:19:22.14,Default,I,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.15,0:19:45.14,Default,Inuchiyo,0,0,0,,What about their camp?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.14,0:19:46.95,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,General Katsuie is on her way.{meh honorifics}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.17,0:19:58.94,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,Someone, protect me!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.73,0:20:01.32,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,E-Everyone?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.32,0:20:03.18,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,Where have you gone to?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.06,0:20:07.40,Default,I,0,0,0,,Imagawa Yoshimoto, prepare to die!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.41,0:20:12.52,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,H-How dare you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.85,0:20:15.01,Default,I,0,0,0,,This is the way of the world.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.01,0:20:17.52,Default,I,0,0,0,,Your life is mine!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.11,0:20:20.74,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.74,0:20:23.38,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,I don't want to be killed here!{JP phrased differently but TL was the same. What're the differences?}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.91,0:20:24.99,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wait, Katsuie!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.55,0:20:26.74,Default,S,0,0,0,,Don't kill her!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.25,0:20:28.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's a waste!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.20,0:20:30.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,If we kill a hot girl like that,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.56,Alt,,0,0,0,overlap,Stop... Stop...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.46,0:20:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll regret it the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.71,0:20:35.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,Don't kill her.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.56,0:20:36.42,Default,S,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.97,0:20:38.26,Default,I,0,0,0,,I won't kill her...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.26,0:20:44.22,Default,I,0,0,0,,I won't kill her, so stop fondling my breasts!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.97,0:20:47.64,Default,S,0,0,0,,Glad you understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.72,0:20:50.16,Default,I,0,0,0,,I've been tainted.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.93,0:20:55.23,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.65,0:20:58.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna's retainer. Sagara Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.89,0:21:00.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,Imagawa Yoshimoto,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.69,0:21:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,the war is over.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.81,0:21:04.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,Surrender.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.99,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,I-I can't...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.61,0:21:11.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's a total waste for a cute \Ngirl like you to die here.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.18,0:21:16.30,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,I-I suppose there's no alternative.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.30,0:21:22.90,Default,Imagawa,0,0,0,,I'll let you off easy, just this \Ntime, so you don't look bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.13,0:21:27.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,Thanks. I mean it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.95,0:21:34.23,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,With Yoshimoto's surrender, \Nher forces scattered,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.67,0:21:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Imagawa clan, known as the \Nstrongest in the east, fell from power.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.09,0:21:46.64,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's thanks to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.64,0:21:47.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.07,0:21:50.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,Then I need to receive a reward.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.19,0:21:52.58,Default,N,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.70,0:21:54.96,Default,N,0,0,0,,I heard from Katsuie.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.96,0:21:57.58,Default,N,0,0,0,,You tainted her by \Ngrabbing her breasts!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.99,0:22:00.84,Alt,S,0,0,0,,{\an8}No, that's a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.01,0:22:00.84,Default,N,0,0,0,,And you let Yoshimoto off \Nbecause she was cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:01.78,0:22:04.17,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's also a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.89,0:22:07.60,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Now, Princess, a victory cheer.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.60,0:22:09.05,Default,N,0,0,0,,I know already.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:10.43,0:22:12.31,Default,N,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.31,0:22:17.72,Default,N,0,0,0,,Hip-hip-hooray!{lol}
